6
00:05:38,712 --> 00:06:07,535
to ensure that this ordinance, which is related to law enforcement identification and masking, to make sure that that lined up with the policies of the Medford Police Department. And I do want to mention that when we first brought this up, it was because Renee Good and Alex Pretty had both recently been killed by ICE.

