38
00:18:04,182 --> 00:18:31,351
No, you're all right. I'm unmuted. Can you hear me? Yes, I can hear you. I would love to co-sponsor this. I think I was added on last minute when this was in the regular session. I'm really grateful for Councilor Callahan for doing so much work. I know we've worked on a lot together with residents. We had a meeting with Chief Buckley, as was mentioned.

